<title>SINGAPORE: Kian Ann share offer 30.4 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>Kian Ann share offer 30.4 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kian Ann Engineering Ltd said on Thursday its initial public offer was 30.4 times subscribed at the close of the offer on Thursday.</p>
<p>The heavy equipment machinery distributor had offered 30 million shares at Singapore $0.60 each.</p>
<p>- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
